j_q3twbm0_x2m5i6UEAL14gmw&oe=6AFB422C"}, {"file_name": "TestIslem_1.png", "id": "1844631876917005", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824665_1844631880250338_8949012750114850755_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UrQBaOyDIrgQ7kNvwE_C2NZ&_nc_oc=AdqS_lh2w_pH4PimXVftUpzBJDOgtHngAbz-vGwczgH92Px3P9Js8sZJgh6C9HSkB-g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR5gy_r1irl7FpUXPDcmD65unTKJSTyLHuEKKrD_qFwEQ&oe=6AFB1B39"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "TEDA\u015e Dijital At\u00f6lye", "keywords": [], "long_description": "The TEDA\u015e Dijital At\u00f6lye Virtual Reality Application is a training system developed to increase the effectiveness and efficiency of technical training provided for the electricity distribution sector.\nThe equipment and facilities used in the field have been modelled in three dimensions on the basis of their actual dimensions and technical specifications. Using a virtual reality headset, the user experiences the field environment virtually and carries out technical operations in accordance with field procedures.\nThe application includes scenarios covering a wide range of subjects, such as equipment identification and assembly, measurement and testing procedures, fault detection, maintenance activities and network switching operations. The scenarios have been prepared on the basis of the operational steps followed in the field.\nIn these scenarios, occupational health and safety practices are treated as an integral part of the work itself.\nVirtual reality technology allows operations that carry risk in a real environment, or that affect the operation of the network, to be repeated safely and as often as required, and enables training to be delivered independently of time and place.", "short_description": "The TEDA\u015e Dijital At\u00f6lye Virtual Reality Application is a training application that enables the practical learning of technical operations carried out on the electricity distribution network in a virtual environment. The equipment and facilities used in the field have been modelled on the basis of their actual dimensions and technical specifications, allowing the user to experience work steps in accordance with occupational health and safety rules."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1092334416670686", "locale": "tr_TR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "TEDA\u015e Dijital At\u00f6lye", "keywords": [], "long_description": "TEDA\u015e Dijital At\u00f6lye Sanal Ger\u00e7eklik Uygulamas\u0131; elektrik da\u011f\u0131t\u0131m sekt\u00f6r\u00fcne y\u00f6nelik teknik e\u011fitimlerin etkinli\u011finin ve veriminin artt\u0131r\u0131lmas\u0131 amac\u0131yla geli\u015ftirilmi\u015f bir e\u011fitim sistemidir.\nSaha ortam\u0131nda kullan\u0131lan te\u00e7hizat ve tesisler, ger\u00e7ek boyutlar\u0131 ve teknik \u00f6zellikleri esas al\u0131narak \u00fc\u00e7 boyutlu olarak modellenmi\u015f olup, kullan\u0131c\u0131 sanal ger\u00e7eklik g\u00f6zl\u00fc\u011f\u00fc arac\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131yla saha ortam\u0131n\u0131 sanal olarak deneyimlemekte ve teknik i\u015flemleri saha prosed\u00fcrlerine uygun olarak ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirmektedir.\nUygulama kapsam\u0131nda; te\u00e7hizat\u0131n tan\u0131nmas\u0131 ve montaj\u0131, \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm ve test i\u015flemleri, ar\u0131za tespiti, bak\u0131m faaliyetleri ve \u015febeke manevralar\u0131 gibi bir\u00e7ok konuda senaryo yer almaktad\u0131r. Senaryolar, sahadaki i\u015flem basamaklar\u0131 esas al\u0131narak haz\u0131rlanm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r.\nSenaryolarda i\u015f sa\u011fl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve g\u00fcvenli\u011fi uygulamalar\u0131 i\u015fin ayr\u0131lmaz bir par\u00e7as\u0131 olarak ele al\u0131nmaktad\u0131r.\nSanal ger\u00e7eklik teknolojisi sayesinde, ger\u00e7ek ortamda risk ta\u015f\u0131yan veya \u015febekenin i\u015fletmesini etkileyen i\u015flemler g\u00fcvenli bi\u00e7imde ve istenilen say\u0131da tekrarlanabilmekte, e\u011fitimler zamandan ve mek\u00e2ndan ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z olarak y\u00fcr\u00fct\u00fclebilmektedir.", "short_description": "TEDA\u015e Dijital At\u00f6lye Sanal Ger\u00e7eklik Uygulamas\u0131, elektrik da\u011f\u0131t\u0131m \u015febekesinde ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirilen teknik i\u015flemlerin sanal ortamda uygulamal\u0131 olarak \u00f6\u011frenilmesini sa\u011flayan bir e\u011fitim uygulamas\u0131d\u0131r. Saha ortam\u0131nda kullan\u0131lan te\u00e7hizat ve tesisler, ger\u00e7ek boyutlar\u0131 ve teknik \u00f6zellikleri esas al\u0131narak modellenmi\u015f olup, kullan\u0131c\u0131 i\u015f ad\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131 i\u015f sa\u011fl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve g\u00fcvenli\u011fi kurallar\u0131 \u00e7er\u00e7evesinde deneyimlemektedir."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.tedas.gov.tr/FileUpload/MediaFolder/c9dcce36-52df-465e-b310-11422cf77617.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "TEDA\u015e", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.tedas.gov.tr/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ar", "tr"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1330212310169139"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1969286043785667"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1969286043785667"}, "is_approved": true, "